#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9750 expect=skipped domain=LB
#note "LBBODSYS populated and no LBBDSYCD column -> both Requirements gates pass and the dataset-level check would fire if LB were in scope. Scope.Domains.Include [AE, CE, MH] rejects LB -> skipped. Mirrors PMDA-SD1461-skipped_out_of_scope_domain-LB, minus the LBBDSYCD column: with it present, Requirements.Variables.None [--BDSYCD] would skip the rule on its own and the scope gate would go unpinned."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBSEQ    type=Num
col LBBODSYS type=Char
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | INFECTIONS
---
